# Dockerfile-specific ignore file (BuildKit picks up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# next to the Dockerfile and uses it instead of the context's .dockerignore).
# Allow-list: only the workspace manifest and the agent crate enter the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-agent/
rust-agent/target/
**/*.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
